OL,3,GNEWSABattery warning after near miss
OL,4,Abin lorry fire in Edinburgh
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe City of Edinburgh Council has
OL,7,Fwarned against putting devices like
OL,8,Fvapes into household waste after bin
OL,9,Fcrews narrowly avoided a fire.
OL,11,FA refuse collector spotted smouldering
OL,12,Frubbish in general waste that had been
OL,13,Fcollected from the Polwarth area of the
OL,14,Fcity at the end of last month.
OL,16,FThe crew had to spill the waste out on
OL,17,Fthe street where the Scottish Fire and
OL,18,FRescue Service (SFRS) were able to
OL,19,Fextinguish it quickly.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
